WEBVTT

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.210
Back then, each one of us...

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.750
...had to make the choice
or we would not have survived.

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.110
No, Brother Shino!

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:34.510
Please! Please don't leave me all alone!

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.200
Don't die!

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.080
Take me with you!

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:41.970
Hamaji...

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:43.720
Sosuke...

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:45.770
Yoshiro...

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:49.600
And here I thought we had
finally become a family...

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.140
Do you wish to live?

00:00:59.990 --> 00:01:01.520
Then make your choice.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:43.780
Borders

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:50.000
This feels heavenly!
It's been so hot lately.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:03.300
Dang, it if ain't the Lord of the Lake!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:07.350
Don't give me a heart attack!
I came here to cool off.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:11.920
Murasame!

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:20.780
Stop that!

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:23.430
I can't believe you found
some random weird thing to eat again.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:27.200
Shino! That belongs to me! Give it back!

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:40.070
This here forest has
been peculiar of late.

00:03:40.460 --> 00:03:43.430
Oh, jeez! Now you're startin'
to talk that way, Old Toad!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:46.080
It's strange how the spirits
have been bustling about.

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:50.080
I can sense a dark, menacing power...

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:52.610
...but apparently it isn't yours.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:10.540
Hanyuu no yado mo, waga yado
Even if it is a cottage, there's no place like home

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:19.960
Tama no yosooi urayamaji
One studded in gems cannot compare

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:29.560
Nodoka nari ya haru no sora
The spring skies are calm

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:39.760
Hana wa aruji, tori wa tomo
The flowers are my master, the birds my friends

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.380
I just finished preparing the tea.

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.160
What do we get to snack on today?

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:49.490
I made enough for you,
Shino, so go dry your hair.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:52.390
You may try some of my
new brew today as well.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:54.770
Oh, a new brew...?

00:04:56.210 --> 00:04:58.270
So, what was in it?

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:01.460
It's a blend of eastern
gentian, fishwort,

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:03.000
ginseng, and soft-shelled turtle blood.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.810
It's good for you.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.800
These muffins taste something lethal.

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:09.680
I will be upset if you throw them away.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:10.890
Seconds.

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:11.720
Huh?!

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:12.540
Most certainly.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.980
Come to think of
it, where is Sosuke?

00:05:17.060 --> 00:05:19.240
Good afternoon! It's me, Inukawa!

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.440
Goodness, Sosuke! You came
at just the right time.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.050
You're a fool of a son!

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:29.680
What is the matter?
What's gotten into you two?

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.080
What's the matter?
Everything's the matter!

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:33.040
This little wretch!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.430
He's constantly ollygagging
instead of goin' to school!

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:39.290
And he just told me that he
torched all of his textbooks!

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:40.060
You burned them?

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:43.800
Sure did! I hate studying!
I'm gonna get a job.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.930
Look at that mouth flap!

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:48.550
You JUST turned 12 not too long ago!

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.800
Shut up, dumb Dad!

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:50.790
Now, now.
Damn it!

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.100
Bro So, I'd be willing
to visit the church,

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.930
so you should teach me instead.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:56.480
I know that's what you want,

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:59.330
but I'm afraid I couldn't
teach you every day.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:01.310
Don't go there. Just don't.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:03.280
If this brat went to your church,

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.710
he'd drive you nuts with his big mouth.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:06.790
And even if it didn't, you gotta

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:09.350
look after your elders
and sickly brother.

00:06:09.350 --> 00:06:12.140
Who the heck is this "sickly brother"?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.320
If you mean Shino,

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.470
he looked fit as a fiddle when I saw
him in the forest the other day.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:16.850
In the forest?

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.370
Ah, crap.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:24.000
M-man, for a little shrimp,
doesn't he act like a big jerk?

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:25.860
You're the bigheaded punk!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:32.870
Ma, I'm gonna walk Bro So to the church!

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:34.970
Be careful while you're out.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.150
You don't have to, Kenta.

00:06:38.150 --> 00:06:39.870
You won't get back until late.
I can go on my own.

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:42.020
I'll be just fine!

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.690
Lately I've been hanging out in

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:45.690
the forest behind the church anyway.

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:48.820
I keep telling you to avoid
that area since it's dangerous.

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:51.640
Are there wild dogs or somethin'?
Or maybe a bear?

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:56.390
I hope that it is merely something
of that nature from this side...

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.510
He's visiting the village again.

00:07:02.510 --> 00:07:04.830
Who knows what diseases
he'll bring with him!

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:07.530
Why don't he hurry on back
to his own village...?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:10.400
'Cause Otsuka Village was
completely burned to the ground.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:13.410
Even now, people are told to keep out.

00:07:13.640 --> 00:07:18.520
Didn't everyone rot to death?
Ya think our village'll be okay?

00:07:18.520 --> 00:07:20.540
See that kid? They're together again.

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.040
Ain’t he that spitfire’s eldest son?

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:25.740
Kenta, it's okay. This is far enough.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.330
It ain't okay!

00:07:27.330 --> 00:07:29.510
I said I was gonna walk ya
to the church, didn't I?

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:30.380
It's cool!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.300
You don't need to worry about
what them villagers say.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:36.750
It does not bother me,
but won't they tease you

00:07:36.750 --> 00:07:39.060
at school again if you're seen with me?

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:42.870
I swear, they're freakin'
out way too much.

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:45.810
It's been five years since
you came to our village.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.950
Supposedly the disease would
spread to this village

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:53.040
if they didn't burn the
houses and corpses.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:55.820
"Supposedly"?

00:07:56.930 --> 00:08:00.270
I have hardly any recollection
of what happened back then.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:01.640
Ya don't say...

00:08:01.640 --> 00:08:03.890
However, if you absolutely insist,

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:06.090
I'd appreciate it if you
walked me to the church.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:09.340
But I'm not so sure about
this going into the forest.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:11.340
That again?

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:15.510
What's that?

00:08:15.870 --> 00:08:16.700
A charm.

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:19.910
I don't believe in no God.

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:21.890
Yeah, but even if you
don't believe in God,

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:26.050
don't you believe in me
since I'm your friend?

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.010
Yeah...

00:08:33.970 --> 00:08:35.340
I just got back.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.670
Welcome home.

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:41.870
No, Kenta was kind enough to

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:43.810
You certainly  had to carry a lot...

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:44.010
help me carry it the whole way here.

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.210
Is that right? What a relief.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:49.060
Thank you, Kenta.

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:51.280
Nah, it wasn't much...

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:52.650
Why're you blushing?

00:08:52.650 --> 00:08:54.300
'Scuse me, Shino?!

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:58.050
Before you two get started,
Shino, I need a word with you.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:03.560
W-well, in that case,
maybe I'll head on home...

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:06.170
It is in regards to
your play spot, Shino.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:11.070
It would seem that we need
to have a quick man-to-man talk.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.380
Isn't that right?

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:18.950
I heard that you went deep into the forest
by yourself the other day.

00:09:19.180 --> 00:09:20.510
A-alone?!

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:22.720
Nope! I was with him!

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:25.460
R-right! Murasame was with me, right?

00:09:25.730 --> 00:09:27.460
I believe I told you, did I not?

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.480
You are not supposed to enter
that forest by yourself.

00:09:31.190 --> 00:09:33.260
I gave Kenta a fair warning,

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.120
but that area has always
been rich in darkness.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.090
It is impossible to say
what could happen to

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.470
someone who is lured
inside by that darkness.

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:41.490
Damn that Kenta! He tattled on me.

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:43.200
He can be such a total jerk, too!

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.620
How wonderful! You two seem
to be on the same page.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:46.850
As if!

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.840
At any rate, humans who are
drawn to the darkness...

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.860
...could hardly be called
normal to begin with.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.410
What about Kenta?

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:57.240
He looks  like your typical brat.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:00.320
Sosuke?

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:04.370
Well, it could be a matter of
me having drawn too close to him.

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:08.870
Don't you mean that
the other way around?

00:10:09.230 --> 00:10:10.410
Personally, I was simply worried

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:12.690
for the lad since his
personality is reminiscent

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:13.880
of a certain someone I know.

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.320
Like the way you can both be jerks.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.130
You were quick to cut me down...

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:20.450
Hey, let me make this perfectly clear.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.030
I act totally normal for my age.

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:26.890
That jerk is the one who's
a little brat on the inside and out.

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:33.210
Indeed, both of you are little brats
on the inside and out.

00:10:37.510 --> 00:10:40.780
Crap! I wonder if he's gettin'
chewed out about now.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.430
Huh, Shino?

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:55.410
Why're you dressed like that?

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:01.430
Shino?

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:06.930
Hey, Shino!

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:09.650
Shino...?

00:11:10.790 --> 00:11:11.550
What gives?

00:11:12.030 --> 00:11:14.530
That was Shino just now, wasn't it?

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:16.190
W-was it a ghost?

00:11:19.090 --> 00:11:20.100
A summons letter?

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:23.450
I can understand if it were
for me, but why Shino?

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.220
I couldn't say...

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:27.650
But the seal  and
signature are both real.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:29.690
Why don't we blow it off?

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.980
That is not an option.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:35.400
The Imperial Headquarters is
most likely searching for Murasame.

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:38.820
Would this imply that the Church

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.970
knows of Murasame's presence here?

00:11:41.240 --> 00:11:43.720
That is highly likely...

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:53.210
Th-that is the...

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:56.250
...black algae from this morning!

00:11:57.500 --> 00:11:59.840
Uh, is it your friend?

00:11:59.840 --> 00:12:02.380
What a most unusual friend...

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.050
And here I was sure to throw it away.

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:06.660
Do you think it will cover
the window's repair fees?

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:08.740
Rio!

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:12.120
An intriguing report just came in.

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.140
Oh?

00:12:13.640 --> 00:12:17.320
Apparently they've found the survivors
from Otsuka Village.

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:19.990
Shino Inuzuka, Sosuke Inukawa,

00:12:19.990 --> 00:12:22.130
and I believe
there was a girl named Hamaji.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.390
It seems that the Church's
headquarters have taken

00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:27.640
the initiative and issued
a summons for the two men.

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:29.330
Is that right?

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.620
And here you are, feigning ignorance!

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:35.460
I know all about how Murasame
went missing from that village,

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:37.650
which landed you in a pot
of boiling hot water.

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.530
Well, I will simply do as I wish.

00:12:46.220 --> 00:12:48.530
In any event, you may have this.
Read it if you're interested.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:49.800
Later!

00:12:53.890 --> 00:12:58.060
Honestly! To think that they
can't even live out normal lives.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:12:59.760
The poor dears.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.540
Morning!

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:18.000
Good morning to you.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:19.110
Good morning, Shino.

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:25.110
Oh, that little dear shrank
right up after I dried him off.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:30.240
It seems that they have already arrived.

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:32.520
This would be your escort.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.760
Shino Inuzuka and Sosuke Inukawa,

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:45.240
under our master's orders,
we have come to escort you.

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.030
Prepare for your departure promptly.

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:48.160
How strange...

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.510
How peculiar!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.780
The scent of humans...

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:52.510
It is similar...

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:54.770
Similar to our own scent.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:57.770
I see. Two lives in one.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:13:59.540
One is a dog?

00:13:59.960 --> 00:14:01.790
What's with these fox punks?!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:02.650
Shino!

00:14:03.590 --> 00:14:05.980
I have a difficult time
believing that the Church

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.730
would send escorts such as these.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:08.970
You there.

00:14:09.090 --> 00:14:11.080
Merged together with that,
your time has frozen, has it not?

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:12.850
Our master is most curious.

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:14.720
He wishes to know what that is.

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:19.320
You guys wanna know what this is?

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:25.130
Very well. We'd be willing to tell you.

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:28.110
Eh, Murasame?

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:05.590
It looks like you broke
their barrier, doesn't it?

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:08.320
Well then, we were in
the middle of breakfast.

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:11.240
Oh, darn! I left the
tea leaves sitting out.

00:15:12.110 --> 00:15:14.220
Unless I am mistaken,
I believe those were

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.800
the Goko Five Foxes of the Osaki family.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:18.290
Indeed, they were.

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:19.600
That's all you have to say?!

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:21.290
Good Heavens!

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:24.110
They have drawn the attention
of some powerful forces.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.340
Bro So!

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:30.600
Kenta?

00:15:31.590 --> 00:15:35.300
The village is all worked up,
so I thought I oughtta fill ya in.

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:36.620
Did something happen?

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:38.760
Three young men from the village

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:40.900
have been missing since last night.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:44.000
Their parents are throwin' fits
since they haven't gone home!

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:46.230
They think the Church was behind this.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:49.760
Three young men?
What were they like?

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:52.050
They were all about your age, Bro So.

00:15:52.280 --> 00:15:54.830
They were lazy good-for-nothings who

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:56.640
spent all of their time goofing off.

00:15:57.290 --> 00:16:00.390
Sometimes I'd catch glimpses of them
in the forest behind the church, so...

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.470
I will go summon Father.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:07.150
Hey, Shino?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:10.320
After I left, weren't you
hanging out in the forest?

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.420
Huh?

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:12.910
The forest?

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:15.410
Wait! I swear I didn't go in!

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:18.560
Yesterday I saw a girl ghost who was the

00:16:18.560 --> 00:16:20.910
spittin' image of Shino
slip into the forest.

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:23.670
She had kinda long hair.

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:25.920
And she was all dressed up in a kimono.

00:16:26.440 --> 00:16:29.170
Ya don't think I saw
a real ghost, do ya?

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.150
You need to go home now.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:31.920
What?

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:35.550
Never come back. And steer
clear of the forest.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:39.600
He's right. It seems
we've grown too close.

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.060
Huh?

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:45.560
I-I don't get why you're suddenly
throwing out all this crazy talk, Shino...

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:48.400
Bro So, not you too...

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:53.650
Shino is absolutely right.
You must not come here anymore.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:56.010
Same for the forest.

00:16:56.890 --> 00:16:59.840
You must on no account
associate with us henceforth.

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:03.020
I don't get it!

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.820
Like I'd ever come back
to a dump like this!

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:05.580
Kenta!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.590
Damn it! Piece of crap!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:16.590
And here he... called me his friend!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:22.510
Shino, please stay here and
behave yourself until I come back.

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:27.830
Pops, how long have you been there?

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.860
I've been here this whole time.

00:17:30.290 --> 00:17:33.020
That boy has drawn a
smidgen too close to you.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:37.870
Drawing close to you is the same as
drawing close to the border.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:41.180
He would make for easy prey
to those on the other side.

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:42.350
Shino...

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:47.620
I just found this outside...

00:17:49.150 --> 00:17:50.910
Kaname, I must apologize.

00:17:51.230 --> 00:17:53.690
I did not expect a child
to possess such a thing.

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:58.280
Yeah, but I guess we're lucky since
we were able to locate Murasame.

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:00.680
For Rio to play dumb, I had figured

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.470
there must be more to the story.

00:18:03.290 --> 00:18:04.110
Well, then.

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.390
It would be inappropriate to coerce him.

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:10.310
We must send an invitation
that will encourage

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:12.140
him to visit us of his own free will.

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:14.900
Wasn't there another survivor
from the Otsuka Village?

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:17.220
I hope that she is a doll.

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:20.240
How is Kenta?

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:22.470
I ran after him, but...

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.910
He hasn't returned home yet, either.

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:28.160
When Shino saw this a while ago,
he rushed out in a hurry.

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:30.290
Didn't you give this
to that boy, Sosuke?

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.900
I am sorry, but I need to run.

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:34.990
Sosuke?!

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:41.250
I swear, this is one trait
they didn't need to share!

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:54.130
Damn it!

00:18:54.130 --> 00:18:54.960
Kenta!

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:56.080
Shino?

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:58.380
Yikes, what is that?

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:02.130
Shino, you REALLY are
Shino, aren't you...?

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:03.660
Huh? What are you-

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:05.570
I mean, otherwise what's that thing

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:07.570
that has been looking
at me this whole time?

00:19:35.630 --> 00:19:37.390
This might... be too much for me.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.200
You jerk! Keep your wits about you!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:52.260
You're late!

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.040
Sorry about that.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.750
But I believe I told you not to

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:58.770
go out on your own before I left, Shino.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:01.300
I couldn't help it! This moron...

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:05.910
Both of you are morons. That
aside, what is that thing?

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:08.680
It seems awfully well
made for mere bait.

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:12.700
M-man, I'm in the dark on this one!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.340
It looks just like you did
five years ago, doesn't it?

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:21.060
Everyone just has to say that!

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:22.200
Murasame!

00:20:34.230 --> 00:20:35.500
Seriously!

00:20:36.010 --> 00:20:39.050
Don't put that misleading crap
on top of your head.

00:20:58.380 --> 00:20:59.990
Nothing stands a chance against you

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:01.750
when you're wielding Murasame, huh?

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:07.450
But there is no point in hiding
the evidence after all of this.

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:09.510
Expect a lecture once we get back.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.340
Thank goodness!

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:25.390
Our influence on him must
have been too great.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:27.850
So long as he is careful, he
should be fine from now on.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:29.030
Yeah...

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:31.390
Shino...

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:35.030
What's this?

00:21:35.030 --> 00:21:37.350
Wasn't Hamaji out with you as well?

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:44.010
Damn it! Where did they take Hamaji?

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:45.390
I imagine the foxes that came to summon

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:48.370
you two this morning must
have whisked her away.

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:51.480
They are the Goko Five Foxes
from the Osaki family,

00:21:51.480 --> 00:21:53.690
one of the Four Houses of the Sacred Beasts
under the Church's care.

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:54.870
The Four Houses of the Sacred Beasts?

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:57.850
There are four families that watch over
the Four Sacred Beasts,

00:21:57.850 --> 00:21:59.380
making them the Four Houses
of the Sacred Beasts.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.860
Children chosen by the Sacred Beasts
are born into these families,

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:05.170
but I have heard that in an attempt
to make that power its own,

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.630
the Church has taken those
children under its wing.

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.450
But doesn't the Church
only believe in one God?

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:13.570
Why would the Church take in children
chosen by the Sacred Beasts?

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:16.230
Naturally, the Church does not wish to

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:18.980
acknowledge the existence of other gods,

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:20.720
but since they do exist,

00:22:20.720 --> 00:22:23.650
the Church wants to obtain
that power for itself.

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:27.150
In which case, the reason why they are
drawing us out is because...

00:22:27.650 --> 00:22:29.730
They are either after Murasame inside

00:22:29.730 --> 00:22:31.840
of Shino or Yoshiro inside of Sosuke.

00:22:31.840 --> 00:22:33.160
That's messed up.

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:36.040
Did one of the Four Houses
of the Sacred Beasts

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.250
take Hamaji to the
Church's headquarters?

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:38.670
Most likely.

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:41.170
That is all I need to know.

00:22:41.690 --> 00:22:44.980
Shino, we are leaving for the
Imperial Capital tomorrow morning.

00:22:44.980 --> 00:22:46.190
Please get packed.

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:48.180
This is such a pain!

00:22:48.860 --> 00:22:50.770
Perhaps, but it cannot be helped.

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:53.180
This is their declaration of war against us.

00:22:53.780 --> 00:22:56.950
It isn't like you to take a slap
and turn the other cheek, is it?

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:00.440
Got it.

00:23:26.010 --> 00:23:41.020
Humans and Demons

00:23:28.150 --> 00:23:29.430
Thanks to Murasame,

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:31.590
I've got some weird
black algae that won't leave me be!

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:32.430
May I eat it?

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:33.750
I already told you: Don't eat it!

00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:35.370
But it looks tasty.

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:36.940
Stop that! Don't peck it!
But it looks tasty.

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:38.030
The insides are spilling out.

00:23:38.030 --> 00:23:40.070
No!
